# alias-keyword ADR (docs/decisions/alias-keyword.md), pin (a).
# A class method aliased via `alias new old` — BOTH names resolve to the ONE
# method body (pure synonym, zero duplicated codegen) and print identical results.

class Bag
  count: Int
  def init
    self.count = 3
  end
  def size -> Int
    self.count
  end
  alias length size
end

def main
  let b = Bag.new
  puts "size=#{b.size}"
  puts "length=#{b.length}"
end
